{"id":"n58152-1-8","stage":1,"title":"여학생 · 女学生","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58152-1-8-1","ko":"우리 과에는 여학생이 별로 없는 것 같아.","zh":"我们系里好像没什么女学生啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과에는","meaning":"科，系","explanation":"과：科，系；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"과","audio":"/audio/ca7de345a0a56a5e7b9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42313","senseId":"2","lemma":"과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여학생이","meaning":"女学生，女生","explanation":"여학생：女学生，女生；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여학생","audio":"/audio/873a9297a28de6cc39d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58152","senseId":"1","lemma":"여학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별로","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"4","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/au